{"v":1,"book":"Prov","ch":11,"verses":[{"n":1,"text":"A false balance is an abomination to Jehovah, But a full weight is His delight.","tok":[{"t":"A "},{"t":"false","s":["H4820"],"a":[1]},{"t":" "},{"t":"balance","s":["H3976"],"a":[0]},{"t":" is an "},{"t":"abomination","s":["H8441"],"a":[2]},{"t":" to "},{"t":"Jehovah","s":["H3068"],"a":[3]},{"t":", But a "},{"t":"full","s":["H8003"],"a":[5]},{"t":" "},{"t":"weight","s":["H0068"],"a":[4]},{"t":" is His "},{"t":"delight","s":["H7522"],"a":[6]},{"t":"."}]},{"n":2,"text":"When pride comes, then comes dishonor; But wisdom is with the humble.","tok":[{"t":"When "},{"t":"pride","s":["H2087"],"a":[1]},{"t":" "},{"t":"comes","s":["H0935"],"a":[0]},{"t":", then "},{"t":"comes","s":["H0935"],"a":[2]},{"t":" dishonor; But "},{"t":"wisdom","s":["H2451"],"a":[6]},{"t":" is with the humble."}]},{"n":3,"text":"The integrity of the upright will guide them, But the perverseness of the treacherous will destroy them.","tok":[{"t":"The "},{"t":"integrity","s":["H8538"],"a":[0]},{"t":" of the "},{"t":"upright","s":["H3477"],"a":[1]},{"t":" will "},{"t":"guide","s":["H5148"],"a":[2]},{"t":" them, But the "},{"t":"perverseness","s":["H5558"],"a":[3]},{"t":" of the treacherous will "},{"t":"destroy","s":["H7703"],"a":[5]},{"t":" them."}]},{"n":4,"text":"Riches do not profit in the day of wrath, But righteousness delivers from death.","tok":[{"t":"Riches","s":["H1952"],"a":[2]},{"t":" do not "},{"t":"profit","s":["H3276"],"a":[1]},{"t":" in the "},{"t":"day","s":["H3117"],"a":[3]},{"t":" of "},{"t":"wrath","s":["H5678"],"a":[4]},{"t":", But "},{"t":"righteousness","s":["H6666"],"a":[5]},{"t":" "},{"t":"delivers","s":["H5337"],"a":[6]},{"t":" from "},{"t":"death","s":["H4194"],"a":[7]},{"t":"."}]},{"n":5,"text":"The righteousness of the perfect man will make his way straight, But the wicked man will fall by his own wickedness.","tok":[{"t":"The "},{"t":"righteousness","s":["H6666"],"a":[0]},{"t":" of the "},{"t":"perfect","s":["H8549"],"a":[1]},{"t":" man will make his "},{"t":"way","s":["H1870"],"a":[3]},{"t":" straight, But the "},{"t":"wicked","s":["H7563"],"a":[6]},{"t":" man will "},{"t":"fall","s":["H5307"],"a":[5]},{"t":" by his own "},{"t":"wickedness","s":["H7564"],"a":[4]},{"t":"."}]},{"n":6,"text":"The righteousness of the upright will deliver them, But the treacherous will be taken in their own craving.","tok":[{"t":"The "},{"t":"righteousness","s":["H6666"],"a":[0]},{"t":" of the "},{"t":"upright","s":["H3477"],"a":[1]},{"t":" will "},{"t":"deliver","s":["H5337"],"a":[2]},{"t":" them, But the treacherous will be "},{"t":"taken","s":["H3920"],"a":[5]},{"t":" in their own craving."}]},{"n":7,"text":"When a wicked man dies, his expectation will perish; And the hope of the strong perishes.","tok":[{"t":"When a "},{"t":"wicked","s":["H7563"],"a":[2]},{"t":" "},{"t":"man","s":["H0120"],"a":[1]},{"t":" dies, his "},{"t":"expectation","s":["H8615"],"a":[4]},{"t":" will "},{"t":"perish","s":["H0006"],"a":[3]},{"t":"; And the "},{"t":"hope","s":["H8431"],"a":[5]},{"t":" of the "},{"t":"strong","s":["H0205"]},{"t":" "},{"t":"perishes","s":["H0006"],"a":[7]},{"t":"."}]},{"n":8,"text":"The righteous man is delivered out of trouble, And the wicked man comes into it instead of him.","tok":[{"t":"The "},{"t":"righteous","s":["H6662"],"a":[0]},{"t":" man is delivered "},{"t":"out","s":["H2502"],"a":[2]},{"t":" of "},{"t":"trouble","s":["H6869"],"a":[1]},{"t":", And the "},{"t":"wicked","s":["H7563"],"a":[4]},{"t":" man "},{"t":"comes","s":["H0935"],"a":[3]},{"t":" into it instead of him."}]},{"n":9,"text":"With his mouth the profane man destroys his neighbor, But through knowledge the righteous will be delivered.","tok":[{"t":"With "},{"t":"his","s":["H2611"],"a":[1]},{"t":" "},{"t":"mouth","s":["H6310"],"a":[0]},{"t":" the profane man "},{"t":"destroys","s":["H7843"],"a":[2]},{"t":" his neighbor, But through "},{"t":"knowledge","s":["H1847"],"a":[4]},{"t":" the righteous will be "},{"t":"delivered","s":["H2502"],"a":[6]},{"t":"."}]},{"n":10,"text":"When it goes well with the righteous, the city exults; And when the wicked perish, there is a ringing shout.","tok":[{"t":"When it goes "},{"t":"well","s":["H2898"],"a":[0]},{"t":" with the "},{"t":"righteous","s":["H6662"],"a":[1]},{"t":", the "},{"t":"city","s":["H7151"],"a":[3]},{"t":" exults; And when the "},{"t":"wicked","s":["H7563"],"a":[5]},{"t":" "},{"t":"perish","s":["H0006"],"a":[4]},{"t":", there is a ringing "},{"t":"shout","s":["H7440"],"a":[6]},{"t":"."}]},{"n":11,"text":"By the blessing of the upright the city is exalted, But it is torn down by the mouth of the wicked.","tok":[{"t":"By the "},{"t":"blessing","s":["H1293"],"a":[0]},{"t":" of the "},{"t":"upright","s":["H3477"],"a":[1]},{"t":" the "},{"t":"city","s":["H7176"],"a":[3]},{"t":" is "},{"t":"exalted","s":["H7311"],"a":[2]},{"t":", But it is torn down by the "},{"t":"mouth","s":["H6310"],"a":[4]},{"t":" of the "},{"t":"wicked","s":["H7563"],"a":[5]},{"t":"."}]},{"n":12,"text":"He who despises his neighbor lacks sense, But a man of understanding keeps silent.","tok":[{"t":"He who "},{"t":"despises","s":["H0936"],"a":[0]},{"t":" his neighbor lacks sense, But a "},{"t":"man","s":["H0376"],"a":[4]},{"t":" of "},{"t":"understanding","s":["H8394"],"a":[5]},{"t":" keeps silent."}]},{"n":13,"text":"He who goes about as a gossip reveals secrets, But he who is of a faithful spirit conceals a matter.","tok":[{"t":"He who goes about as a gossip "},{"t":"reveals","s":["H1540"],"a":[2]},{"t":" "},{"t":"secrets","s":["H5475"],"a":[3]},{"t":", But he who is of a "},{"t":"faithful","s":["H0539"],"a":[4]},{"t":" "},{"t":"spirit","s":["H7307"],"a":[5]},{"t":" "},{"t":"conceals","s":["H3680"],"a":[6]},{"t":" a "},{"t":"matter","s":["H1697"],"a":[7]},{"t":"."}]},{"n":14,"text":"Where no sound counsel is, the people fall; But in the multitude of counselors there is safety.","tok":[{"t":"Where no sound "},{"t":"counsel","s":["H8458"],"a":[1]},{"t":" is, the "},{"t":"people","s":["H5971"],"a":[3]},{"t":" "},{"t":"fall","s":["H5307"],"a":[2]},{"t":"; But in the "},{"t":"multitude","s":["H7230"],"a":[5]},{"t":" of counselors there is "},{"t":"safety","s":["H8668"],"a":[4]},{"t":"."}]},{"n":15,"text":"He who is surety for a stranger will surely be troubled, But he who hates giving pledges is secure.","tok":[{"t":"He who is "},{"t":"surety","s":["H6148"],"a":[3]},{"t":" for a "},{"t":"stranger","s":["H2114"],"a":[4]},{"t":" will "},{"t":"surely","s":["H0982"],"a":[7]},{"t":" be troubled, But he who "},{"t":"hates","s":["H8130"],"a":[5]},{"t":" giving pledges is secure."}]},{"n":16,"text":"A gracious woman lays hold of honor, And violent men lay hold of riches.","tok":[{"t":"A "},{"t":"gracious","s":["H2580"],"a":[1]},{"t":" "},{"t":"woman","s":["H0802"],"a":[0]},{"t":" lays hold of honor, And violent men lay hold of "},{"t":"riches","s":["H6239"],"a":[6]},{"t":"."}]},{"n":17,"text":"The merciful man rewards his own soul, But the cruel troubles his own flesh.","tok":[{"t":"The "},{"t":"merciful","s":["H2617"],"a":[3]},{"t":" "},{"t":"man","s":["H0376"],"a":[2]},{"t":" rewards his own "},{"t":"soul","s":["H5315"],"a":[1]},{"t":", But the "},{"t":"cruel","s":["H0394"],"a":[6]},{"t":" "},{"t":"troubles","s":["H5916"],"a":[4]},{"t":" his own "},{"t":"flesh","s":["H7607"],"a":[5]},{"t":"."}]},{"n":18,"text":"The wicked man earns deceitful wages, But he who sows righteousness gets a true reward.","tok":[{"t":"The "},{"t":"wicked","s":["H7563"],"a":[0]},{"t":" man earns "},{"t":"deceitful","s":["H8267"],"a":[3]},{"t":" wages, But he who "},{"t":"sows","s":["H2232"],"a":[4]},{"t":" "},{"t":"righteousness","s":["H6666"],"a":[5]},{"t":" gets a true "},{"t":"reward","s":["H7938"],"a":[6]},{"t":"."}]},{"n":19,"text":"He who is steadfast in righteousness shall attain to life, And he who pursues evil advances to his own death.","tok":[{"t":"He who is steadfast in "},{"t":"righteousness","s":["H6666"],"a":[1]},{"t":" shall attain to "},{"t":"life","s":["H2416"],"a":[2]},{"t":", And he who "},{"t":"pursues","s":["H7291"],"a":[3]},{"t":" "},{"t":"evil","s":["H7451"],"a":[4]},{"t":" advances to his own "},{"t":"death","s":["H4194"],"a":[5]},{"t":"."}]},{"n":20,"text":"Those who are perverse in heart are an abomination to Jehovah, But those who are perfect in their way are His delight.","tok":[{"t":"Those who are perverse in "},{"t":"heart","s":["H3820"],"a":[3]},{"t":" are an "},{"t":"abomination","s":["H8441"],"a":[0]},{"t":" to "},{"t":"Jehovah","s":["H3068"],"a":[1]},{"t":", But those who are perfect in their "},{"t":"way","s":["H1870"],"a":[6]},{"t":" are His "},{"t":"delight","s":["H7522"],"a":[4]},{"t":"."}]},{"n":21,"text":"Be assured: The evil man will not go unpunished; But the seed of the righteous will be delivered.","tok":[{"t":"Be assured: The evil man will not go "},{"t":"unpunished","s":["H5352"],"a":[3]},{"t":"; But the "},{"t":"seed","s":["H2233"],"a":[5]},{"t":" of the "},{"t":"righteous","s":["H6662"],"a":[6]},{"t":" will be "},{"t":"delivered","s":["H4422"],"a":[7]},{"t":"."}]},{"n":22,"text":"Like a nose-ring of gold in a pig’s snout, So is a beautiful woman who is without discretion.","tok":[{"t":"Like a nose-ring of "},{"t":"gold","s":["H2091"],"a":[1]},{"t":" in a "},{"t":"pig’s","s":["H2386"],"a":[3]},{"t":" "},{"t":"snout","s":["H0639"],"a":[2]},{"t":", So is a "},{"t":"beautiful","s":["H3303"],"a":[5]},{"t":" "},{"t":"woman","s":["H0802"],"a":[4]},{"t":" who is "},{"t":"without","s":["H5493"],"a":[6]},{"t":" "},{"t":"discretion","s":["H2940"],"a":[7]},{"t":"."}]},{"n":23,"text":"The desire of the righteous is only good, But the expectation of the wicked is wrath.","tok":[{"t":"The "},{"t":"desire","s":["H8378"],"a":[0]},{"t":" of the "},{"t":"righteous","s":["H6662"],"a":[1]},{"t":" is only "},{"t":"good","s":["H2896"],"a":[3]},{"t":", But the "},{"t":"expectation","s":["H8615"],"a":[4]},{"t":" of the "},{"t":"wicked","s":["H7563"],"a":[5]},{"t":" is "},{"t":"wrath","s":["H5678"],"a":[6]},{"t":"."}]},{"n":24,"text":"There is one who scatters and increases yet more, And there is one who withholds what is appropriate but ends up only in want.","tok":[{"t":"There "},{"t":"is","s":["H3426"],"a":[0]},{"t":" one who "},{"t":"scatters","s":["H6340"],"a":[1]},{"t":" and "},{"t":"increases","s":["H3254"],"a":[2]},{"t":" yet more, And there is one who "},{"t":"withholds","s":["H2820"],"a":[4]},{"t":" what is appropriate but ends up only in want."}]},{"n":25,"text":"The blessing soul will prosper, And he who waters will also be watered himself.","tok":[{"t":"The "},{"t":"blessing","s":["H1293"],"a":[1]},{"t":" "},{"t":"soul","s":["H5315"],"a":[0]},{"t":" will prosper, And he who "},{"t":"waters","s":["H7301"],"a":[3]},{"t":" will also be "},{"t":"watered","s":["H3384"],"a":[6]},{"t":" himself."}]},{"n":26,"text":"As for him who withholds grain, the people will curse him; But blessing will be upon the head of him who sells it.","tok":[{"t":"As for him who "},{"t":"withholds","s":["H4513"],"a":[0]},{"t":" "},{"t":"grain","s":["H1250"],"a":[1]},{"t":", the "},{"t":"people","s":["H3816"],"a":[3]},{"t":" will "},{"t":"curse","s":["H5344"]},{"t":" him; But "},{"t":"blessing","s":["H1293"],"a":[4]},{"t":" will be upon the "},{"t":"head","s":["H7218"],"a":[5]},{"t":" of him who "},{"t":"sells","s":["H7666"],"a":[6]},{"t":" it."}]},{"n":27,"text":"He who diligently seeks good seeks favor; But as for him who searches after evil, it will come to him.","tok":[{"t":"He who diligently "},{"t":"seeks","s":["H7836"],"a":[0]},{"t":" "},{"t":"good","s":["H2896"],"a":[1]},{"t":" "},{"t":"seeks","s":["H1875"],"a":[4]},{"t":" favor; But as for him who searches after evil, it will "},{"t":"come","s":["H0935"],"a":[6]},{"t":" to him."}]},{"n":28,"text":"He who trusts in his riches will fall, But the righteous will flourish like the green leaf.","tok":[{"t":"He who "},{"t":"trusts","s":["H0982"],"a":[0]},{"t":" in his "},{"t":"riches","s":["H6239"],"a":[1]},{"t":" will "},{"t":"fall","s":["H5307"],"a":[3]},{"t":", But the "},{"t":"righteous","s":["H6662"],"a":[5]},{"t":" will "},{"t":"flourish","s":["H6524"],"a":[6]},{"t":" like the green leaf."}]},{"n":29,"text":"He who troubles his own house will inherit the wind, And a fool will be servant to the wise in heart.","tok":[{"t":"He who "},{"t":"troubles","s":["H5916"],"a":[0]},{"t":" his own "},{"t":"house","s":["H1004"],"a":[1]},{"t":" will "},{"t":"inherit","s":["H5157"],"a":[2]},{"t":" the "},{"t":"wind","s":["H7307"],"a":[3]},{"t":", And a "},{"t":"fool","s":["H0191"],"a":[5]},{"t":" will be "},{"t":"servant","s":["H5650"],"a":[4]},{"t":" to the "},{"t":"wise","s":["H2450"],"a":[6]},{"t":" in "},{"t":"heart","s":["H3820"],"a":[7]},{"t":"."}]},{"n":30,"text":"The fruit of the righteous man is a tree of life, And he who is wise wins souls.","tok":[{"t":"The "},{"t":"fruit","s":["H6529"],"a":[0]},{"t":" of the "},{"t":"righteous","s":["H6662"],"a":[1]},{"t":" man is a "},{"t":"tree","s":["H6086"],"a":[2]},{"t":" of "},{"t":"life","s":["H2416"],"a":[3]},{"t":", And he who is "},{"t":"wise","s":["H2450"],"a":[6]},{"t":" wins "},{"t":"souls","s":["H5315"],"a":[5]},{"t":"."}]},{"n":31,"text":"If the righteous man will be recompensed on the earth, How much more the wicked man and the sinner!","tok":[{"t":"If the "},{"t":"righteous","s":["H6662"],"a":[1]},{"t":" man will be "},{"t":"recompensed","s":["H7999"],"a":[3]},{"t":" on the "},{"t":"earth","s":["H0776"],"a":[2]},{"t":", How much more the "},{"t":"wicked","s":["H7563"],"a":[6]},{"t":" man and the "},{"t":"sinner","s":["H2398"],"a":[7]},{"t":"!"}]}]}
